    redrawn: the launcher never runs our binding for a previewLayout, so the icon
    has to be a static resource, and a hand-copied path would be the first thing
    to drift from what the widget actually draws.

    Regenerate with ExportPreviewVectorsTest (see the branch history) if the
    previewed categories ever change. White fill, tinted by the ImageView that
    shows it, exactly like the placed widget's masks.
-->
